        {
            "talkId": "6960501",
            "initDialog": "696050101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050101",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "...As you know, my fellow Ratniki occasionally gather to play cards — both as a pastime, and to strengthen their bonds. What I'm trying to say is, I've been looking forward to this match for a long time..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960502",
            "initDialog": "696050201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's play Genius Invokation TCG."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960503",
            "initDialog": "696050301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "I've got other things to do right now..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "696050302",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "Leaving already? The time really has flown by... A rare occurrence indeed."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960504",
            "initDialog": "696050401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050401",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "Well played. I thoroughly enjoyed our match, but if intuition serves, it seems you were holding back? I appreciate your thoughtfulness, but it would be a great honor to witness your skills in full."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960505",
            "initDialog": "696050501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050501",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "Hahaha, wonderful! As the saying goes, how one plays cards is a reflection of how one fights. If I may be so bold, your card skills are as captivating as your prowess in battle."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960506",
            "initDialog": "696050601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050601",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "I appreciate your kind invitation. I may not know the rules yet, but if you don't mind, I'd be happy to have a friendly spar to pass the time."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960508",
            "initDialog": "696050801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's play Genius Invokation TCG."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960509",
            "initDialog": "696050901",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696050901",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let me adjust my deck first..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960510",
            "initDialog": "696051001",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696051001",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "It appears that luck was on my side this time, hehe."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960511",
            "initDialog": "696051101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696051101",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "A defeat I readily concede."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960512",
            "initDialog": "696051201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696051201",
                    "speaker": "Flins",
                    "text": "I feel honored that you're inviting me to play again. Thanks to the help of my comrades, my skills have sharpened considerably. I hope you'll find this an enjoyable match."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6960514",
            "initDialog": "696051401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "696051401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Let's play Genius Invokation TCG."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
